Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:36:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Logging tab: choose what to log by topic

Configure > General > Logging replaces the log fields of the Debug tab. One
checkbox per topic (SpotPass and background tasks, StreetPass, internet and
network, friends/accounts/online play, eShop and titles, HOME Menu/applets/
sleep, save data and files, system calls, sound, graphics, controls) logs
that topic's classes at Debug, so a tester can be asked to tick a box by
name instead of typing log classes. A level for everything else, and under
Advanced the log filter itself (written by the boxes, still editable;
hand-written entries are kept), the regex filter, console output, flush on
every message and Open Log Location.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
